WEBVTT

00:00:09.359 --> 00:00:10.143
Hi there.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:14.223
Welcome to this video where we are 
going to learn about digital identity.

00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:19.135
In today's digital world, we all use
devices connected to the internet,

00:00:19.215 --> 00:00:22.223
and these devices help systems
recognize who we are.

00:00:23.103 --> 00:00:25.535
The goal of this video 
is to help you understand

00:00:25.535 --> 00:00:28.735
what digital identity is
and why it matters.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:32.895
First, we will look at 
what identity means in everyday life.

00:00:33.055 --> 00:00:36.623
Then we will explore 
how identity works online.

00:00:37.423 --> 00:00:39.983
Finally, we will explain why protecting

00:00:39.983 --> 00:00:42.975
your digital identity is important.

00:00:47.343 --> 00:00:50.335
Every person has an identity in real life.

00:00:50.943 --> 00:00:53.343
Your identity includes
things like your name,

00:00:53.343 --> 00:00:56.863
your face, your voice,
and how other people recognize you.

00:00:57.583 --> 00:00:59.871
These things help people know who you are

00:00:59.871 --> 00:01:02.863
at school, at home, and in your community.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.943
When we use digital devices

00:01:04.943 --> 00:01:08.431
connected to the internet,
we also have an identity online.

00:01:09.103 --> 00:01:11.583
This is called a digital identity.

00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:14.191
Just like in real life,
your digital identity

00:01:14.191 --> 00:01:17.183
helps systems and people 
recognize you online.

00:01:17.471 --> 00:01:21.151
Your digital identity is created
when you use online services,

00:01:21.231 --> 00:01:24.223
apps, games, or school platforms.

00:01:24.671 --> 00:01:27.263
Each time you log in or create an account,

00:01:27.263 --> 00:01:30.271
part of your digital identity is used.

00:01:30.351 --> 00:01:33.343
Usernames are one
part of your digital identity.

00:01:33.743 --> 00:01:37.023
They are often the name
that systems use to recognize you.

00:01:37.711 --> 00:01:42.383
Some people use their real name, while
others use nicknames or made up names.

00:01:43.071 --> 00:01:46.223
Profile pictures
are another part of digital identity.

00:01:46.911 --> 00:01:49.903
These images help others
recognize you online,

00:01:49.983 --> 00:01:52.991
just like a photo on an ID card.

00:01:53.103 --> 00:01:56.943
In games and virtual worlds,
people often use avatars.

00:01:57.631 --> 00:02:00.671
An avatar is a character
or image that represents you,

00:02:00.911 --> 00:02:02.623
even if it looks different from you.

00:02:02.623 --> 00:02:05.631
It is still part of your digital identity.

00:02:05.743 --> 00:02:09.071
School accounts are an important part
of your digital identity.

00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:14.543
They allow you to access learning 
platforms, homework, and communication tools.

00:02:20.031 --> 00:02:20.783
Your digital identity

00:02:20.783 --> 00:02:23.791
is connected to your digital assets.

00:02:24.463 --> 00:02:27.631
Digital assets are things
that belong to you online,

00:02:27.743 --> 00:02:30.751
such as photos, messages, and schoolwork.

00:02:31.071 --> 00:02:35.983
You might be using a school system
to store school projects, so your digital

00:02:35.983 --> 00:02:39.823
assets are homework, documents,
or even some topic related images.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.230
If someone gets access
to your digital identity,

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.222
they may also get access
to your digital assets.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:49.982
That is why protecting
your digital identity is so important.

00:02:50.622 --> 00:02:54.942
Protecting your digital identity helps
keep your information private and safe.

00:02:55.102 --> 00:02:59.150
It also helps prevent other people
from pretending to be you online.

00:03:00.110 --> 00:03:03.150
In the next videos,
you will learn about authentication

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:07.262
and passwords, which are tools
that help protect your digital identity.

00:03:08.062 --> 00:03:12.110
Understanding your digital identity
is the first step to staying

00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:16.702
safe online and making responsible
choices in digital environments.

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.566
So in this video,

00:03:21.566 --> 00:03:25.006
we learned what digital identity is
and why it matters.

00:03:28.462 --> 00:03:30.030
Thank you for watching.

00:03:30.030 --> 00:03:32.974
Do not forget to watch
other videos in our series.